  "description": "High-throughput JSON-RPC 2.0 server library for .NET Standard 2.0 through .NET 10: UTF-8 bytes in and out, no JSON library dependency, with Json.NET, System.Text.Json and ASP.NET Core hosting as companion packages.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
